Copernicus Emergency Management Service, EMSR773
------------------------------------------------

Datasets: flood (1,528 patches of the observed flood), graded_buildings
(3,906 graded buildings, one point each) and area_mapped (the area of
interest, one outline)

Publisher: the Copernicus Emergency Management Service, On-Demand
Mapping (Rapid Mapping), European Commission Joint Research Centre;
activation EMSR773, "Flood in Valencia Region, Spain", requested on
29 October 2024 by Spain's Directorate-General for Civil Protection and
Emergencies. The product is the grading map of area of interest 3, Horta
Sud, version 2, delivered on 6 November 2024 ("Correction of observed
event. In particular not all flood traces were delineated."), made from a
GeoEye-1 image taken on 31 October 2024 at 10:22 UTC.
https://mapping.emergency.copernicus.eu/activations/EMSR773/

Licence: the Copernicus data policy (LicenseRef-Copernicus-Data-Policy).
The service's terms (last modified 7 June 2023) state that its data is
