https://mapping.emergency.copernicus.eu/terms-and-conditions/
https://mapping.emergency.copernicus.eu/about/citation-guidelines/

Credit: Copernicus Emergency Management Service (© 2024 European Union),
[EMSR773] Horta Sud (AOI03): Grading Map, the form the citation
